## 5. 完成后写 status

```bash
cat > tasks/status/<CATEGORY>_${TASK_ID}.json <<EOF
{
  "task_id": "<CATEGORY>/${TASK_ID}",
  "status": "done",
  "completed_at": "$(date -Is)",
  "commit_sha": "$(git rev-parse HEAD)",
  "outputs": [...],
  "stats": {...},
  "notes": "",
  "pitfalls_added": []
}
EOF
```

---

## 6. dashboard + push

```bash
cd tasks && python3 build_dashboard.py && cd ..
git add <data_paths> tasks/status/ tasks/MASTER_PROGRESS.md tasks/MASTER_PROGRESS.html tasks/pitfalls.md
git pull --rebase origin main
git commit -m "feat(<scope>): dispatch <CATEGORY>/${TASK_ID} 完成"
git push origin main
```

push 失败（race） → `git pull --rebase` → 重跑 `build_dashboard.py` → `git add … && git commit --amend --no-edit && git push`。

---

## 7. 踩坑回写

撞到非显然 bug / 隐藏约定 / 反直觉默认行为 → append `tasks/pitfalls.md` 一条新 ID（`pf-YYYY-MM-DD-N`）+ 三段（症状/原因/解决）+ 触发任务 ID；status 的 `pitfalls_added` 数组写新 ID。
